Package: proxor
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: polkitd, pkexec, libcap2-bin
Description: Qt proxy client for sing-box profiles
 Proxor is a Qt-based client for managing sing-box proxy profiles,
 subscriptions, and routing. TUN authorization remains an explicit action
 performed by the user; installation does not grant network capabilities.
